WEBVTT

00:00:00.058 --> 00:00:02.612
Your final kickoff and handoff should let a new agent find

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:05.248
the governing documents, identify the revision or

00:00:05.306 --> 00:00:08.626
baseline, know what is allowed, and take the first safe

00:00:08.673 --> 00:00:09.195
action.

00:00:09.636 --> 00:00:12.887
Ask the fresh reader to identify any contradiction or

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:13.967
missing dependency.

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:18.355
A useful handoff also distinguishes built, offline-tested,

00:00:18.738 --> 00:00:22.128
provider-accepted, live-observed, and pending.

00:00:22.825 --> 00:00:25.484
If your capstone is only a plan, say so.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:28.061
That is a valid outcome for this exercise.
